      "version": 104,
      "versionNonce": 1093659605,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788412259104,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Scope of the problem statement:\n• Employee is the master record. Required views: Kanban, List and Form.\n• Contracts need List and Form. Payroll should rely on the active Running contract.\n• Attendance needs List and Form linked to the employee.\n• Time Off must expose Requests, Allocations and Time Off Types only from Time Off ▼ in the navbar.\n• Time Off balance logic: approved Allocations grant balance; approved Requests consume balance based on the selected Time Off Type.\n• Payroll scope: Payrun, Payslips, Salary Structures and Salary Rules, with PDF payslips and employee email delivery from a Payrun.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scope of the problem statement:\n• Employee is the master record. Required views: Kanban, List and Form.\n• Contracts need List and Form. Payroll should rely on the active Running contract.\n• Attendance needs List and Form linked to the employee.\n• Time Off must expose Requests, Allocations and Time Off Types only from Time Off ▼ in the navbar.\n• Time Off balance logic: approved Allocations grant balance; approved Requests consume balance based on the selected Time Off Type.\n• Payroll scope: Payrun, Payslips, Salary Structures and Salary Rules, with PDF payslips and employee email delivery from a Payrun.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
