      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Expected participant understanding:\n• Users can browse employees in Kanban or List, but both must open the same Employee Form.\n• Contracts are related child records of the employee.\n• The Employee Form should act as the central hub through smart buttons.\n• Payroll logic should clearly depend on the current Running contract.",
