      "updated": 1788412266335,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "• NEW opens a setup wizard; it does not immediately create a payrun.\n• Pay Run Setup defines Employee Types, Pay Structure, and Period.\n• Continue opens the employee selection step.\n• Only employees selected in this second step should be included in the Payrun.\n• Create Payrun creates the batch and takes the user to the Payrun form, where payslips can be computed, reviewed, validated, paid, generated as PDF, and sent to employees.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• NEW opens a setup wizard; it does not immediately create a payrun.\n• Pay Run Setup defines Employee Types, Pay Structure, and Period.\n• Continue opens the employee selection step.\n• Only employees selected in this second step should be included in the Payrun.\n• Create Payrun creates the batch and takes the user to the Payrun form, where payslips can be computed, reviewed, validated, paid, generated as PDF, and sent to employees.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
