    {
      "id": "69WNQe--sajtSLUxaWp17",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 367.1975867386818,
      "y": -3005.867346901756,
      "width": 1292.7083740234375,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 196106562,
      "version": 269,
      "versionNonce": 1957849252,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788419904336,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Employee & Contract\n\n- Employees should be viewable in both Kanban and List views.\n- Opening an employee should show their HR details and related records such as Contracts,\nAttendance, Time Off, and Allocations.\n- An employee can have multiple contracts over time.\n- Payroll should use the contract applicable to the selected payroll period.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "VAX8IqJ5sdPC_FN0YPxRS",
      "originalText": "Employee & Contract\n\n- Employees should be viewable in both Kanban and List views.\n- Opening an employee should show their HR details and related records such as Contracts, Attendance, Time Off, and Allocations.\n- An employee can have multiple contracts over time.\n- Payroll should use the contract applicable to the selected payroll period.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ENz0XkeLdTBOOuHuEShQZ",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 267.1023486434442,
      "y": -1432.016156425565,
      "width": 1400.000000000001,
      "height": 294.3452380952382,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQa",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 345497858,
      "version": 480,
      "versionNonce": 880862108,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788419904336,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "cT3LsAaTeL_iCRq8dcAaH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 272.1023486434442,
      "y": -1427.016156425565,
      "width": 1218.8125,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQb",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1857581250,
      "version": 312,
      "versionNonce": 2066068516,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788419904336,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Attendances: \n\n- Attendance can be accessed globally or from an individual employee.\n- Store check-in, check-out, worked hours, and attendance status.\n- When opened from an employee, only that employee’s attendance should be shown.\n- Attendance data should be usable later for reporting/dashboard insights.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "ENz0XkeLdTBOOuHuEShQZ",
      "originalText": "Attendances: \n\n- Attendance can be accessed globally or from an individual employee.\n- Store check-in, check-out, worked hours, and attendance status.\n- When opened from an employee, only that employee’s attendance should be shown.\n- Attendance data should be usable later for reporting/dashboard insights.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "beuIVH5As4PJ0Etvm7lRH",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -731.8381275470333,
      "y": -880.4090135684219,
      "width": 1211.2500000000007,
      "height": 395,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
